    "Turbo Richard|IND": { p: "Richard's appeal is his ability to create explosive runs with sharp cuts and make defenders miss, rather than simply take what a running lane gives him. That is a useful fantasy trait if it earns more work. The October 24 view was cooler on his recent stretch than the October 6 view, so the early excitement should not be treated as a settled workload projection.", l: "Opinion informed by assessments dated Oct 6 and Oct 24, 2026. Not independent film study." },
