    "John Mateer|OKLA": { p: "Mateer's fantasy case needs to balance his scoring on the ground against the reliability of his passing. In 12 games for Oklahoma in 2025, he threw 14 touchdowns and 11 interceptions while adding eight rushing touchdowns. The rushing scores explain part of the appeal, but the passing line gives reason to question whether exciting moments will translate into dependable quarterback play and a lasting NFL starting opportunity.", l: "Opinion informed by a September 15, 2026 evaluation, with complete 2025 counting stats. Not independent film study. These are college results, not NFL fantasy projections.", s: "Source: Wikipedia, John Mateer, revision 1382956113 (2026-10-31T05:12:33Z), CC BY-SA 4.0.", u: "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Mateer" },
